<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Akorintho</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwarakha yo nayelhi i Napaolo wa attu o Ukorintho</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Akorintho</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Ako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Iwarakha yo nayelhi i Napaolo wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Attu o Ukorintho</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uhohelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha yo nayelhi i Napaolo wa attu o Ukorintho yaalhepiye ni Napaolo iyaakha cho 55-56 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo (nlhako wo 1:1). Ilha phi imoka yo iwarakha pilhi chirina ihu chilhepiye ni Napaolo urwaa wo milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ukorintho. Attu o ushoma anorumelhelha wiira Napaolo ahopacha ulhepa iwarakha yo waachachera milhoko cha attu anrumelhelhe Kuristo o Ukorintho. Nansho vano khanirina yeyo iwarakha inoromolhiya nlhako wo 2:3-4:2 iyo. Iwarakha yo nayelhi wa attu o Ukorintho ilha inoonia wiira yaalhepiye ni Napaolo vaari aya Umakedoniya (nlhako wo 2:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha yo nayelhi wa attu o Ukorintho iri yo yekha aya ukhalhawaya ilhepiye imwaachaka ntu mmoka mmoka, tho inowusha mirima. Nhina mmo Napaolo anoohimiacha uteelhiya waya vaneewa aya malhove oteelhiha nrima ankhuma u Natito anaacha nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ukorintho. Nhina ilha iwarakha ilha, ninowoona meettuchiho aneettuchihiya wo urata aachaka mwaha wo ukumiha isadaka thoko chinohimiya ni Malhehano o Naanano, hasa vakittu Napaolo vanolhehera aya mwaha wo upocheriya nchurukhu wiira ukushiye ni urweehiya waakavihere attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Uyerusalemu (nlhako wo 8-9). Tho inowoonia wiira owiittuchiha akina o woothacha ahiri o mmilhokoni mwa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo yahovarelha nipesha no uhiiwananiya ni Napaolo upatta iphiro yo wiivaha ipilhi mmilhokoni mmo. Yaari yaahelhaka attu nipampa wo ukoherera ikuru yaarina aya Napaolo. Yeyo nkayaakhalha phi ittu yaahenlhe nrima Napaolo, nkayaathepa uhimiechesha ikuru aya yo ukhalha karumiya a Yesu Kuristo, mpaka vanomalhihera aya iwarakha yo nayelhi wa attu o Ukorintho ilha.</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Napaolo anoochokholha iwarakha aya wo waashikuria nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo (nlhako wo 1:1-7).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, Napaolo anowulhumacha mwaha wo urukunusha nnikwa aya wo weeta mikwaha, tho anoohimiacha mwaha weewilhe aya unaacha yayo manyaattu ayo toka vaapochenre aya iwarakha aya yo upachera (nlhako wo 1:8-7:16).</para>
  <para style="io">Baada yo vavawo, Napaolo anoowaalhaka attu mwaha unaacha upocheriya nchurukhu wo nlhatu wo waarwehelha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Uyerusalemu (nlhako wo 8:1-9:15).</para>
  <para style="io">Vanomalhiha aya, Napaolo anoohimiacha malhove o winkelha ntheko aya wo ukarumiya ni uhimiacha malhove anaacha nkwaha aya nkina wo nayelhi wo weetelhelha attu o Ukorintho (nlhako wo 10:1-13:10).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Mii Paolo, karumiya a Kuristo Yesu kiihaniye wo uttuna wa Nlhuku, kiri vamoka ni munnihu Timotheo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Kinolhepa iwarakha iwe uwaninyu mwaattiva nrii nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ukorintho, vamoka ni attu onkhaye a Nlhuku kila vakittu mu Uakaya mu.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Ninoulhapelhelhani nnema ni mpuha ukhuma wa Nlhuku Athumwanihu ni Athithi Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anonshukuru Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Atotopelhiye Nlhuku Athumwanaya Athithi Yesu Kuristo, Athumwanihu o ikiriri, Nlhuku noteelhiha mirima cha attu onkhaye. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Nlhuku phi noniteelhiha mirima mu uhuvani wihu mwonkhaye. Akina vanohuva aya naateelhihe mu uhuvani waya wo kila iphiro, wo yoyo nrima unonihelha awe uyo. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Eiyo, thoko chineera ihu wo utwarushiya wo uvara ntheko wa Kuristo, phi chiichammo Nlhuku chinothepa awe uniteelha mirima chihu chinene wo iphiro ya Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Nahuvaka, paahi etu irii wo nlhatu wo uhelhiya nrima ni woopolhiya winyu. Nateelhihiyaka nrima iri wo nlhatu wo uhelhani nrima mwaatti wiira mpatte machiri o uvilhelha ntwarusho yoyoyoyo unotwaruwa ihu hii uyo. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Tho, ukhulhuvelha urina ihu wo nlhatu winyu uheemelha rata. Ukhalhawaya nihochuwelha wiira nakhalhaka vamoka mu utwarushiyani wihu ni inyu chiicho nnookhalha akavihi mu uteelhiyani nrima wihu. <verse eid="2CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ashilhoko ihu, ninothanana uchuwelhihani mwaha wo uhuva waanipatilhe ilhapo yo Uasiya ilhe. Wowo uhuva wahonithepelha upwaha chinooria ihu uvilhelha, mpaka nkanaakhwa nrima wonkhaye wiira khaninolhama ni ukhalha akumi. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Eiyo, mmamirimani mwihu neechoona thoko attu ahukumulhiye wiiviya. Nansho yeerelhe chiicho wiira niittuchihiye unkhulhuvelha Nlhuku naahihimusha akhwilhe, wo uhikulhuvelha machiri ihu hiyaano naashinene. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Yayo yahonoopolha mu itatako yulhupalhe thoko yelhe yaathanana uniiva ilhe. Ni ayo anoothepa unoopolha, ni hiyaano niheeshera nikhulhuvelho nihu wiira anonoopolha tho. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Ni inyu mwaatti nnikavihaka wo iphiro yo unilhapelhelha. Paahi etu, chechiyo ibarakha chinowa ihu upatta wo nlhatu wo waakhulhiya unilhapelha winyu uwo, chinowa chaakhalha nlhatu wo attu enchi unlhapelha ni unshukuru Nlhuku wo nlhatu wihu.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anorukunusha nkwaha waya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Hii nineeshipa wo ittu imoka. Nrima ihu uhinonihimiechesha wiira niholhokelha velhaponi va, chinene nikhalhaka munlhokoni mwinyu, wo wiitimarikha ni utakatifu uvaheriye ihu ni Nlhuku. Khanipannge chiicho wo irusho cha ntu nansho wo nnema wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Ukhalhawaya khaninolhepa malhove makina ahinooria inyu ushoma ni uchuwelha, nansho ayo anooria inyu ayo. Kinokhulhuvelha wiira, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />nnonichuwelha rata cheene, inakhalhaka wo naanano va nnichuwenlhe vakani tu. Ukhalhawaya nihochuwelha wiira, nihuku no uhokolhia tho Athithi Yesu nno nnoowa mweefuna wo nlhatu wihu, thoko ni hii chinowa ihu wiifuna wo nlhatu winyu mwaattiva va.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ukhalhawaya kaari kikhulhuvelhaka, kaholhakelha uwa uwaninyu khalhayi vawo wiira mpatte ibarakha cho nkwaha wo nayelhi. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Kaholhakelha uvirelha uwaninyu vanorwaa aka nkwaha wo ulhukama ilhapo yo Umakedoniya ni ikatema yo uhokolhia chiicho, wiira kiwe kaapatta ittu uwaninyu yo ukikavihera nkwaha aka wo Uyudea. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Chani, nnaanyihera wiira vaalhakenlhe aka chiicho kaari thoko ntu o urukunuwacha? Ama chani, nnaanyihera wiira vanopanga aka kinopanga wo irusho cho munttuni ni wiira kineera “Eiyo,” ni “Kuhiwe” vavawovavawo? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Nlhuku phi o ukhulhuvelhiya chinene, paahi ilhe inoohimeria ihuni ilhe khanihii nlhove no “Eiyo” ama no “Kuhiwe” vavawovavawo. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Yesu Kuristo, Mwaana a Nlhuku, nanhimianche ihu mii ni Nasuluwano ni Natimotheo uwaninyu, kaahiwe ntu o “Eiyo” ama o “Kuhiwe”. Nansho yoyo aari ntu o “Eiyo” ya Nlhuku mahuku onkhaye. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Ukhalhawaya nhina mwawe, malhehano onkhaye a Nlhuku ahokhalha “Eiyo.” Paahi etu vaneera ihu “Aye” wo iphiro ya Kuristo, nineera wo nlhatu wo unthimicha Nlhuku.<verse eid="2CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Nlhuku mwanene phi nonilhipiha hii ni inyu mwaattiva chiicho mu ulhutaanani ni Kuristo. Ni uyo phi nonihika makhura. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Phi uyo nivanhe Iphumu mmamirimani mwihu wooniha wiira awawe ni ukhalha imboote yo chittu chonkhaye chineeshenre awe.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Nlhuku phi o ukihimiechesha, hochuwelha nrima aka wiira kinohimiaka phi ikeekhene! Paahi etu, akaawilhe tho Ukorintho uwo, wo uwoonelhani ikiriri vaattuna aka uchacherani vawo. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Khaninottuna utawarani vachulhu mwaha unopishera inyu nrima, nihochuwelha wiira mwaatti nheemelha rata munrimani. Nansho ninovara ntheko vamoka ni inyu wo nlhatu wo uteelhiha mirima chinyu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Paahi kiholhakelha wiira kihiwe uwaninyu tho wo uchuwelha wiira, kihiwe kooweriani mirima chinyu. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ukhalhawaya kooweriakani mirima chinyu mwaattiva, mpani nolhoha ukiteelhiha nrima? Phi inyu mwaatti kuwerelhe akani mirimava. <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Kiholhepa iwarakha uwaninyu wiira vanohalha aka uwa vawo, kihiwe kaakelhiya ihuzuni ni attu aaphwanelhiye ukiteelhiha nrima aka. Kihochuwelha wiira mii kateelhiyaka, mwaattiva onkhaye nnoowa mwaateelhiya chiicho. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Vaalhempe aka iwarakha ilhe uwaninyu, kihuvaka ni uchukulhachaka munrimani, kunlhaka miithori pakatapakata, khayari wo nlhatu wo uweriani munrimani nansho wo uwonihani wiira kinowuttunani chinene.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulhevelhelhiya ntu wonnye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ntu mmwerelhe munrimani ntu nkina, khakiwerelhe mii vekha aka, nansho owerelheni mwaattiva onkhaye. Ni mii akittunaka ukhalha ntu o uchacha chinene. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Utwarushiya unotwarushiya awe ni attu enchi uwo, unonthosha yoyo ntu uyo. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Paahi etu ittu ihalhenlhe iri ambaya unhiyerera yoyo ntu uyo ni unhelha nrima wiira hiwe aathepa ukhalha nkhwaachuni chinene ni ukhwa nrima. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Wo chiichammo etu kinowushontelhani, mmwooniheke wiira nnonttuna chinene. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Kaalhempe iwarakha ilhe wo uthanana uchuwelha yakhalhaka nnowooria ukiiwelhelha wo kila nlhove. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Mwanlhevelhelhaka ntu nlhatu wawe ni mii kinonlhevelhelha. Ukhalhawaya vanolhevelhelha aka, yakhalhaka kihanaa nlhove no unhiyerera, kinonhiyerera mmiholho mwa Kuristo wo nlhatu winyu, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />wiira nihimmahe Nakare iphiro yo unithepiacha, ukhalhawaya nihochuwelha irusho chawe chiri aya.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napaolo wi iwani yo Utroa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Vano etu vaaphilhe aka Utroa uhimiachani Malhove Orera a Kuristo, kahophwanya Athithi ahokihulhelha nlhako wo uvara ntheko aka wowo, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />nansho kahothemwa chinene munrimani wo nlhatu wo uhimphwanya munnihu Tito. Paahi kahaalheha attu vavawo nkakaarwaa Umakedoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukottolha wo iphiro ya Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Nansho ninshukuruku Nlhuku noniholhelha kila nihuku mu mphingo wo wooniha ukottolha wihu muulhutaanani ni Kuristo. Yoyo phi nonooriha niwanelhihe ikeekhene ya Kuristo thoko nihiriri no unukhelha chinene kila vakittu. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Ukhalhawaya hii niri thoko nihiriri noombone no ubani kuminhe awe Kuristo wa Nlhuku, nihiriri ninaaphiyelha attu onkhaye, anoopolhiya ni ayo anopotera. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Wo alhe anopotera alhe hii phi nihiriri no nookhwa nansho wo alhe anoopolhiya alhe hii phi nihiriri ninowiiha ukumi. Phi mpani etu nooria ukaviha ntheko wo yeyo iphiro iyo? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Paahi etu, hiyaano kanihiwe thoko attu akina anochurusha Nttenga wa Nlhuku thoko maronda. Nansho hiyaano nilhutanne ni Kuristo va, ninohimiacha wo ikekhiaye mmiholho wa Nlhuku, thoko attu arumiye ni Nlhuku.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Akarumiya o Malhehano o Naanano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Chani, nihochokholha tho wiishipa naashineneru? Ama niwiiheke iwarakha yo unichuwelhiha uwaninyu ama nithananeke iwarakha ukhuma uwaninyu thoko attu akina chineera aya? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Mwaattiva mwaashinene phi iwarakha ihu ilhepiye mmamirimani mwihu inochuwania ni ushomiya ni kila ntu. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Phi ikekhiaye wiira mwaattiva phi iwarakha ya Kuristo irwenhe awe wo iphiro yo mitheko chihu. Iwarakha inene iyo khilhepiye wo wino nansho wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku ri nkumi ihilhepiye vanlhuku nihemiye nansho mmamirimani mwa attu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Ninoolhumacha yayo wo uhoova, wo nlhatu wo ukhulhuvelha urina ihu mmiholho wa Nlhuku wo chittu chaapangiye ni Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Khiiwo inonooriha hii upanga ittu iriyoothe wo wooria wihu naashinene, nansho wooria wihu wonkhaye unokhuma wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Ukhalhawaya yoyo phi noorinhe uvara ntheko wo ukarumiya o Malhehano o Naanano ahirii malhehano o ikekhia ilhepiye, nansho malhehano o Iphumu ya Nlhuku. Ukhalhawaya ikekhiaye phi nommwiiha nookhwa nansho Iphumu ya Nlhuku phi nowiiha ukumi.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Paahi etu yakhalha malhove o ntheko unommwiiha nookhwa aalhepiye vachulhu vibau cho malhuku o uhemiya, ni uwa wo nthimicho wo waaria chinene, mpaka ata attu o Israeli nkayoocheelha uweha ikhove ya ashinna Musa, wo nlhatu wo waaria waya. Ukhalhawaya ikhove aya yaaria nthimicho wa Nlhuku, inakhalhaka wahowalhawalha wo uhipicha. Yakhalhaka etu malhehero anommwiiha nookhwa yaawiilhe wo nthimicho mwinchi thoko chiicho, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />chani ntheko wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku khunkhalha ni nthimicho mulhupalhe chinene? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Yakhalhaka wahaawo nthimicho wo ntheko waawihilhe ihukumu, iri mwaari etu wiira ntheko wo ikekhia unowiiha ukumi unookhalha ni nthimicho mulhupalhe chinene. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Ukhalhawaya nthimicho waari khalhayi vawo ulhe wahomalha machiri aya, vano nthimicho mulhupalhe chinene uhokusha ntheko waya. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ukhalhawaya yakhalhaka ilhe yo ikatema ikani ilhe yaari ni nthimicho waya, paahi etu we ikekhiaye iyo yo ulhokelha mahuku o uhimalha iyo inowa ukhalha yo nthimicho mulhupalhe chinene.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Ukhalhawaya ulha phi ukhulhuvelha wihu, paahi etu hiyaano ninoolhumacha wo uhoova ittu. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Hiyaano khanihii thoko ashinna Musa yeetiyelhenlhe ikitambaa wiitho wiira attu o Israeli ahoone nthimicho ulhe vaawalhawalha aya. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Nansho irusho chaya chahophupuwalhihiya. Ata lhelho vanoshomiya aya Malhehano o Khalhayi, yeyo itiyelhelho iyo inariwo. Itiyelhelho iyo inowa uthamihiya tu ntu vanohalha awe ulhutaana ni Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Ata lhelho nna vanoshomiya aya Malhehero aavahiye aya ashinna Musa, mirima chaya chinokhalha chinatiyelhelhiye ni ikitambaa iyo. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Nansho ikatema ntu vanaahokolhelha awe Athithi Yesu, itiyelhelho iyo inoothamihiya. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Vaa “Athithi” phi Iphumu ya Nlhuku, ni vakittu varii Iphumu ya Athithi, vavawo phiri uneethi. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Paahi, hiyaano onkhaye nihitiyelhelhiye ikhove chihu, ninowooniha nthimicho wa Athithi thoko waaria wo vakiooni, ninoorukunushiya wiira nilhikaane ni ayo wo nthimicho mwinchi chinene unokhuma wa Athithi arii phi Iphumu ya Nlhuku.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nhakhu wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku nhina chittu chuupiye wo ulhoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku wo ikiriri awe honivaha ulha ntheko ulha, paahi etu khaninokhwa nrima. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Nihohiya malhove onkhaye anoolhiha muru ni o nivithoni. Khaninonthepiacha ntu riyoothe mena urukunusha nlhove na Nlhuku. Ninoohimiacha ikeekhene mwaari, wiira attu onkhaye arumelhelhe mmamirimani mwaya chiri ihu mmiholho wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Nansho inakhalhaka Malhove Orera anohimiacha ihu ahovithiya, paahi avithiye tu wo alhe anopotera alhe. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Yayo khanorumelhelhacha ukhalhawaya irusho chaya chihotiyelhelhiya ni Nakare nlhuku o ilha ilhapo ilha, ahoone nthuko wo Malhove Orera o nthimicho wa Kuristo lhikaanne ni Nlhuku chiri awe. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ukhalhawaya khanineetangacha hiyaano naashinene nansho ninonhimiacha Yesu Kuristo ri Athithi, hii naashinene nikhalhaka phi anamitheko inyu wo nlhatu wa Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku eerilhe, “Nthuko umwalhelhe mwiipiphini!” Phi uyo nomwalhelha mirima chihu ni univaha irusho cho nthimicho wa Nlhuku unomwalhelha ikhove ya Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Paahi, hii niri thoko chittu chuupiye wo ulhoko va, phi nikhupi ninoshunga nhakhu wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku, yooniye mwaari wiira machiri molhupalhe ayo anokhuma wa Nlhuku mena kuhiwe uwanihu hii naashinene. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Mahuku onkhaye ninowaamererihiya nansho khaninonyakathia. Ninookelhiya nipampa nansho khaninokhwa nrima. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Ninootwaruwa nansho khaninohiiya. Ninoowulhushiya vathi, nansho khanineeviya. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ikatema chonkhaye ninomweetana nookhwa a Kuristo mwiiruttuni mwihu ikhalhe wiira ukumi awe Yesu wooniye mwiiruttuni mwihu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Eiyo, ikatema chonkhaye vari ihu akumi va nookhwa noonivinga wo nlhatu wo unkaviha Yesu ntheko awe, ikhalhe wiira ukumi awe wooniye mu iruttu chihu chinokhwa chi. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Ilha phi nooniha hii niri tayari ata ukhwa, wiira mwaatti mpatte ukumi uhimmalha.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Kahorumelhelha, paahi etu nkakoolhumacha.” Ni hii chiicho, wo yoyo nrima wo urumelhelha uyo ninoorumelhelha ni ninowulhumacha. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ukhalhawaya nihochuwelha wiira Nlhuku aahihimunshe Athithi Yesu nonihihimusha ni hii nikhalhe vamoka ni Yesu ni uneesha mmiholho mwawe vamoka ni inyu mwaatti. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Alha onkhaye alha anopangiya wo nlhatu winyu mwaatti. Ikhalhe wiira nnema wa Nlhuku vanaaphiyelha aya attu enchi chinene ni chinene, nrima wo ushukuru wunchererie chinene wo nthimicho wa Nlhuku.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukhalha wo upisha nrima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu khaninokhwa nrima inakhalhaka iruttu chihu chinoothaalha. Nansho iphumu chihu cho nhina chinowuupiya tho kila nihuku. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Ukhalhawaya uhuva unohuva ihu uri vakani, tho uri wo mahuku vakani tu. Nansho, unowa univaha nthimicho umpwaha onkhaye alha, nthimicho wo mahuku o uhimalha, uhimalha uri wo rera upwaha uhuva wihu wu. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Wo chiichammo etu nihiweherere chittu chinoonia, nansho chittu chihinoonia. Ukhalhawaya chittu chinoonia chiri cho mahuku vakani tu. Nansho chihinoonia chilhe phiri cho mahuku o uhimalha.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Iruttu cho wiirimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Ukhalhawaya nihochuwelha wiira nna nihema ninokhalha ihu vano velhaponi nna, yaani iruttu chihu chi vanohalha aya uphomolhiya vawo, Nlhuku noonivaha inupa ikina wiirimu. Inupa yo mahuku o uhimalha ihithekiye ni miono cha attu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Ukhalhawaya wo ikekhiaye vanokhalha ihu nnihemani mu ninowiipulhelha, niwehereraka chinene uwarihiya iruttu cho naanano cho wiirimu. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Eiyo, ukhalhawaya vanohalha ihu uwara iruttu cho wiirimu, nihiwe noonia khanirina iruttu. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Vanokhalha ihu mu nihema no velhaponi mu, ninowiipulhelha wo utwarushiya. Kuhiwe wo nlhatu wo uthanana urulha ilha iruttu yo ukhwa ilha, nansho wo uthanana uvahiya iruttu ihinokhwa ilhe wiira yo ukhwa ilha irukunushiye ipatte ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Nlhuku mwanene ahoneeshera wowo urukunushiya uwo. Ni uyo honivaha Iphumu awe akhalhe imboote yo chittu chonkhaye chineshenre awe.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Niri o uhoova ikatema chonkhaye, inakhalhaka nihochuwelha wiira vanothepa ihu ulhokelha mu ilha iruttu ilha vekha aya phi waakhalhelha Athithi utayi. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Ukhalhawaya ninokhalha wo upisha nrima, kuhiwe wo woona. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Nansho khaninoova nithananaka chinene uhiya ilha iruttu ilha, nithame nakhalhe wa Athithi. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Nlhove nilhonke chinene phi nna, uthanana waateelhiha Athithi. Ikhalhe mu iruttu cho velhaponi mu ama wowo uri aya uwo. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Ukhalhawaya onkhaye nihothananiya neemelhe uri ihiche yo uhukumulhelha ya Kuristo. Kila mmoka apochere inophwanelhiya awe wo mitheko chipangilhe awe mwiiruttuni mwawe velhaponi, mitheko choombone ama cho uhilhoka.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waathanihiya ni Nlhuku wo iphiro ya Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Paahi etu nachuwelhaka waathimicha Athithi, ninoominda wiira naapatte attu. Nlhuku noochuwelha wiira mirima chihu choombone, kikhulhuvelhaka wiira ni inyu nhochuwelha chiicho. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Kuhii wiira ninolhikacha tho wiikhuwelhelha naashinene, nansho ninothanana uvahani mwaatti milhatu cho wiishipa wo nlhatu wihu, wiira mwoorie waakhulha alhe aneeshipa wo meetelho aya o vathe upwaha chiri aya munrimani. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Nooniaka ukhalha attu o ihalhahalha yeyo iri wo nlhatu wo unteelhiha Nlhuku. Ni vavawo nakhalhaka ni irusho chihu rata, yeyo phi nlhatu winyu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ukhalhawaya uttuna wa Kuristo unoniholhelha hii ninochuwelha wiira ntu mmoka tu phi khwilhe wo nlhatu wa attu onkhaye. Paahi ni hii attu onkhaye nihonkhwaana. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Yoyo aakhwilhe wo nlhatu wa attu onkhaye. Ikhalhe wiira attu anolhokelha, ahilhokelhe wo wiiteelhiha ashineneru nansho wo unteelhiha yoyo aakhwilhe uyo nkaahihimushiya wo nlhatu waya.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Paahi toka vano hii khaninomphima ntu riyoothe wo irusho cho munttuni. Ata inakhalhaka ikatema imoka nahomphima Kuristo wo irusho cho munttuni, vano khanineera chiicho tho. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ntu riyoothe alhutaanaka ni Kuristo nokhalha o naanano, malhove o khalhayi ahovira, ahokhalha o naanano. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Chonkhaye phi mitheko cha Nlhuku noniiwananiha hii ni uyo wo iphiro yo nookhwa a Kuristo, nonivaha ntheko wo weewananiha attu akina ni uyo. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Phi neera ihu, Nlhuku aheewananiha attu onkhaye o velhaponi ni uyo wo iphiro yo nookhwa a Kuristo wo uhaalhakelha uwonya wa attu. Yoyo mwanene honivaha nttenga wo weewananiha attu vamoka ni uyo.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Paahi hii nirumiye vanipuro na Kuristo, ninoushontelhani chinene mwaatti thoko Nlhuku mwanene noolhumacha ni inyu wo iphiro ihu. Ninowulhapelhelhani chinene wo iphiro yo nookhwa a Kuristo wiira mmwiiwanane Nlhuku. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kuristo khaawonnye, nansho Nlhuku ahonthathiha milhatu chihu cho uwonya ikhalhe wiira wo ulhutaana ni uyo nikhalhe attu o ikekhia mmiholho wa Nlhuku.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Paahi, hii ninovara ntheko vamoka ni Nlhuku ninowulhepelhani mwaatti wiira nhihononache nnema wa Nlhuku upochenre inyu uyo, nvarelhelheke rata. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ukhalhawaya mu Malhove Matakatifu Nlhuku neera choo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">“Ikatema inolhoka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">Kahowiiwelhelhani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">Ikatema yo uwoopolhani vaayilhe aya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">Kahookavihani.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Paahi nkiiweke etu! Naanano va phi ikatema yo upochera ikiriri ya Nlhuku lhelho phi nihuku noombone no woopolhiya!<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Khaninottuna umweeshera itiyelhelho ntu riyoothe wiira attu ahinrumelhelhe Kuristo, ntheko ihu uhiwe waanyoholhiya. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Itulhi waya, wo kila ittu inopanga ihu ninowooniha we ikekhiaye ukhalha akarumiya a Nlhuku, wo uvilhelha chinene ikatema vanotwarushiya ihu, vanokwana ihu ni ikatema inohuva ihu. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Nihaatiya, nihottukiya njeerani nihopangelhiya injarare, nihovara ntheko wo ulhipa nkanoochaa. Nihoshelhelhiha venchi ni ukhalha wo uhilhia. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Nineechooniha ukhalha akarumiya a Nlhuku wo urera nrima ni ukhalha ni irusho ni uvilhelha ni ukhalha ni nrima woombone. Ninookhulhuvelha machiri o Iphumu ya Nlhuku ni waattuna attu we ikekhiaye kuhii wo unafiki. <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />Nihohimiacha nttenga wo ikeekhene wo machiri a Nlhuku. Ikerero chihu cho waatakanelha ni wiichaakiha chikhalhaka phi upanga chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Ninoothimichiya ni uveehachiya, ninookuphulhachiya ni utotopelhiya. Ninooniya thoko attu owoothacha, nansho inohimiacha ihu phi ikeekhene. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Ninokhalha thoko attu o uhichuwania, nansho nichuwelhiyaka ni attu onkhaye, ninoonia thoko attu akhwilhe nansho ni akumi. Ninowaatiya nansho khaninokhwa.<verse eid="2CO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Inakhalhaka nihohelhiya ihuzuni, khaniiviye. Inakhalhaka ninoochukulha, ninootelhiya mahuku onkhaye. Nihookhalharu amashikini mashikinini nansho ninowaavaha attu enchi nhakhu. Ninoonia ukhalha attu nihirii ni ittu iriyoothe nansho nihanaa kila ittu.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Mwaatti ashilhoko ihu attu o Ukorintho, nahoupatakulhelhani kila ittu, khanouvintheni ittu iriyoothe, ninouttunani wo mirima chihu chonkhaye. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Hii khaninahiya uttunani mwaatti, nansho mwaattiva phi hilhe mirima cho unittuna hii. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Vano kinowulhumanani mwaatti thoko achishaana aka, mirima chinyu chinittuneke thoko ni hii chineera ihu wo uttunani.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhivaraane ni attu ahinonrumelhelha Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Nhivaraane ni attu ahinonrumelhelha Nlhuku. Chani chittu cho ikekhia chinowaathana ni chittu cho uhilhoka? Nthuko ni ipiphi chinooria chani ukhalha nlhoko mmoka? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kuristo nooria chani waathana ni Nakare? Ntu nonrumelhelha neewanana chani ni attu ahinonrumelhelha? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Inupa ya Nlhuku inaathana chani ni ulhapelha isinyago unopangiya ni attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku? Ukhalhawaya hiyaano phi Inupa ya Nlhuku ri nkumi. Thoko Nlhuku mwanene cheerilhe awe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">“Kinoweesha nipuro naka uwannyaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">Ni ukhalha munlhokoni mwaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">Kinookhalha Nlhuku aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">Ni ayo anookhalha attu aka.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Paahi etu tho Athithi aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">“Nthameke variyari aya, mwiihaulheke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">Nhivare ittu inyalhihiye, ni mii kinoupocherani.”<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />“Mii kinookhalha phi athumwaninyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">Ni inyu mwaatti nnookhalha achishaana aka.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">Phi neera aya Athithi o Wooria wonkhaye.<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Paahi manyampwana aka, alha malhehano alha nivahiye hii. Niihapiheke etu ni uhiya kila ittu inoninanariha mwiiruttuni mwihu ni mirima chihu, nikhalheke atakatifu chinene ni umwoova Nlhuku.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uteelhiya nrima Napaolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Ninoulhepelhani wiira nnivaheke nipesha mmamirimani mwinyu! Khaninampangelha ittu yo uhilhoka ntu riyoothe, khaninammweriaa mena unthepiacha ntu riyoothe. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Akinoolhumacha alha malhove alha wo nlhatu wo uhukumulhani mwaatti thoko chiholhenlhe aka wulhumacha. Ukhalhawaya mwaattiva nri mmamirimani mwihu, nikhwe vamoka, nikhalheke akumi vamoka. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Kinoukhulhuvelhani mwaatti chinene vanoolhumacha aka ni inyu, kinowiishipa wo nlhatu winyu! Vanohuva ihu kihopatta ittu yo ukihelha nrima ni ukiteelhiha chinene.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Ata vaaphiilhe ihu iwani yo Umakedoniya iruttu khachaapantte nipesha no wiittuwa. Uhuvihachiya waari kila mpatta, vathe indewo, munrimani nipampa. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Nansho Nlhuku naahelha nrima attu akhwilhe nrima, honihelha ni hii nrima Natito vawilhe aya. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Kuhiwe uwa waya Natito tu, nansho tho niheewa chenre inyu wo waahelha nrima. Yayo ahonihimeria chineera inyu wo uhuvelha ukoona, chiri inyu ni ihuzuni ni chineera inyu wo uthanana ukinkelha. Nenno nlhove nno nihokiteelhiha munrimani chinene.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ata yakhalhaka iwarakha aka ilhe yahohelhani ichuku, mii akinoona nlhatu wo uchukulha munrimani. Inakhalhaka kahokelhiya ichuku, ukhalhawaya iwarakha aka iyo yahohelhani ichuku, nansho yaari wo ikatema ikani. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Vano kihoteelhiya munrimani, kuhii wo nlhatu wo uchukulha winyu, nansho wo nlhatu wo ichuku inyu irukununshe mirima chinyu nkamwaakhoroma. Mwaahelhiye ichuku wo uttuna wa Nlhuku, ni wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu khanoopangenlheni ittu yo uhilhoka mwaatti wo iphiro iriyoothe. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ukhalhawaya uchukulha unothananiya ni Nlhuku phi norukunusha mirima, phi nommwiiha noopo, pahhi etu khuuwo nlhatu wo uthepa ukhoroma. Nansho uchukulha wa attu o velhaponi phi nommwiiha nookhwa. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Vano etu mwooneke ittu ikhumelhenlhe vanochukulha inyu thoko Nlhuku chinothanana awe. Vano mwaatti nhokhalha attu o mitheko ni attu o uthuthuwa ni woova, nthananaka ukoona, attu o umindaminda, nnottunana nkhanlhe ni unhiyera Nlhuku ahukumulhe. Mwaatti nhoonechesha wo kila iphiro wiira khannanarilhe, nhorera vachulhu nna nlhove nna.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Ata inakhalhaka wiira kaholhepa ilhe iwarakha ilhe, kaalhempe ihikhalhaka wo nlhatu wo ulhe pangilhe ittu yo uhilhoka ulhe ama wo nlhatu wo ulhe aattekelhiye ulhe. Kaalhempe yoonie mwaari mmiholho wa Nlhuku chineera inyu wo uminda wo nlhatu wihu. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Yoyo etu phi nlhatu unihenlhe nrima chinene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Khuwaari uhelhiya nrima vekha ayaru, nansho tho Natito ahoniteelhiha nrima, ukhalhawaya ahohimiacha chenre inyu wo waahelha nrima. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Mii kihototopelhani chinene uwannyaya, ni wo nenno nlhove nno akonne ishoni. Nihouhimeriani ikeekhene mahuku onkhaye ni utotopelhani mwaattiva u Natito ulhe uri we ikekhiaye. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Wo chiichammo etu uttunani waya wo nrima unowunchereria chinene vanoopuwelha aya chinre inyu mwaatti onkhaye wo ukhalha tayari weewelhelha. Ni chenre inyu wo waapochera rata wo nthimicho. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Kinooteelhiya nrima chinene woona wiira kinowooria ukhulhuvelhani mwaattiva chinene wo kila nlhove!<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Urera nrima wa attu a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Ashilhoko aka ninoothanana nchuwelhe nnema wa Nlhuku uvahiye aya milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo, arii Umakedoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o wowo yaholhikachiya chinene mu uhuvani, nansho uteelhiya nrima waya waari wulhupalhe chinene, nkayaakumiha wo nrima woombone inakhalhaka yaari amashikini mashikinini. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Kinowooria uhimiechesha wiira, yahokumiha chittu chinchi chonrie aya ata upwaha chooria aya, wo uttuna waya ashinene. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Nkayanilhepelha chinene wiira avahiye nnema wo ukhalha nlhoko mmoka ni hii, mu ntheko wo waakavihera attu a Nlhuku o Uyudea. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Nenno naari nlhove nahaakhulhuvelha ihu ata vakani mena! Yaachokhonlhe wo wiikumiha ashinene wa Athithi, yamalheke nkayeekumiha uwanihu, thoko chaattuna awe Nlhuku.<verse eid="2CO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo nahaalhepelha Natito yaachokhonlhe yoyo ntheko uyo, wiira athepeke ukaviherani munlhokoni mwinyu, mwoorie umalhiha ntheko wo nnema wo ukumiha wo nrima wo woombone ulha. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Mwaatti nhanaa kila ittu wo winchiva, upisha nrima ni wooria wulhumacha ni irusho chinchi cho uchuwelha chittu ni nrima wo ukuruvalhelha upanga mwo urera ni nrima wo unittuna. Wo chiichammo etu, ninooweherera wiira nnoothepa urera nrima mu ntheko wo uttunana ulha.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Akinoovahani malhehero. Nansho kinothanana uchuwelha ikeekhene yo uttuna winyu chinolhikaana aya ni uttuna wa attu akina. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Ukhalhawaya, mwaattiva nhochuwelha nnema wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo. Yayo inakhalhaka ahanaa kila ittu nansho aheepanga nshikini wo nlhatu winyu, ikhalhe wiira wo ushikini waya, ovaheni nhakhu.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Wo ulha mwaha ulha paahi kinowuvahani nna nlhove nna, iholhoka mwaatti umalhiha vano alhe aachokhonlhe inyu mweechana alhe. Mwaattiva mwaari o upacha kuhiwe wo ukumiharu nansho wo ulhakelha upanga chiicho. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Paahi thoko chinre inyu wo ulhakelha ukaviha ntheko, vano mmalhiheke etu ntheko uyo. Nkumiheke thoko chirina inyu. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ukhalhawaya ntu akhalhaka ni nrima wo ukumiha ittu yo ukaviha, Nlhuku noopochera kila ittu ntu inooria awe ukumiha, kuhii wo chittu chihirina awe.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Mwaatti khamphwanelhiye uhuva wiira akina apatte nipesha no uwukuwelhiya nsigo aya, mena! Nansho nlhikaaneke. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Kila ittu irina inyu wo uthepa vano yaakavihereke attu ahirina, wiira ni ayo vanohalha aya ukhalhana wo uthepa awe yoovahani mwaatti vanohalha inyu ukwana. Phi chiichammo chinohalha aya ulhikaana. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya, “Khungunre chinchi khaarina cho uthepa, ni ulhe khungunre vakani khaawukhuwelhiye.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Natito ni akarumiya ashikhunanaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Kinonshukuru Nlhuku avanhe Natito nrima wo uthanana waakaviha attu, thoko nrima urina aka mii. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Kuhiwe ahowiiraka urumelhelharu wiihana wihu, nansho chiicho ahaana nrima wo uthanana chinene waakaviha attu, ata nkayaanirumelhelha wo uttuna waya anene uwa uwaninyu. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Vamoka ni yayo, ninonruma munnihu mmoka nkina nototopelhiya chinene wo nlhatu wo ntheko wo uhimiacha Malhove Orera a Nlhuku munlhokoni mwa attu onkhaye anrumelhenlhe Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Uthepa vavawo yayo ahothanlhiya ni milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo anittukane munkwahani vanorweeha ihu chittu chikumihiye ni attu chi. Ntheko unovara ihu wo nthimicho wa Athithi ni wooniha nrima wo uttunana ni wo waakaviha attu urina ihu.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Ninothanana ushemba ulhaphachiya unooria ukhumelhelha vachulhu mwaha wo weemelhelha wihu alha mahalha o nrima wo uttunana unokavihera ihu alha. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Nnikwa ihu uri wo ukhalha ni upanga mwo ureraru kuhiwe mmiholho mwa Athithi vekha ayaru, nansho chiicho mmiholho mwa attu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Paahi, vamoka ni manyonnihu ayo ninonruma munnihu nkina ninlhikanche ihu wo iphiro chinchi. Nkanamwoona wiira hanaa nrima mulhupalhe wo ukavihani mwaatti. Ata vano hanaa nrima wo uthepa wo nlhatu wo upisha nrima urina awe uwaninyu mwaatti. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Natito, yayo akarumiya akavihi nanaka ninovara ntheko vamoka wo nlhatu winyu, nansho alha manyonnihu elhi akina alha, yayo phi rumiye ni milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo, anommaha nthimicho Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Paahi mwooniheke uttunana winyu chinre aya wo winchiva, milhoko chonkhaye cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo yooneke we ikekhiaye wiira wiishipa uneeshipa aka vachulhu winyu mwaatti phi we ikekhiaye.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Waakaviha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo ashikhunanihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Akoonaka nlhatu wo ulhepa tho uwaninyu mwaatti mwaha unaacha ntheko inyu wo urweeha ittu yo waakaviha attu a Nlhuku o Uyudea uyo. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Kihochuwelha chiri inyu ni nrima wo waakaviha attu ni mii kaheeshipa vachulhu winyu wo nenno nlhove nno mmiholho mwa attu o Umakedoniya. Keerenlhe wiira, “Ashilhoko ihu o Uakaya arii tayari toka mweechana.” Uminda winyu uhaahelha ntukutta no waakurumicha attu enchi chinene. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Paahi vano etu kihaaruma manyonnihu ayo ikhalhe wiira wiishipa wihu wooniye kuhiwe wo malhoveru, ni wiira nri tayari ni ittu ikuminhe inyu wo nrima wo uttunana, thoko chinre aka wo uhimia. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Ihikhalhe wiira, attu o Umakedoniya vanolhoha aya uwa vamoka ni mii ahuuphwanyeni nhinaaya wiicheesha tayari. Vavawo ninoowa noolhiya muru, wo uhaalhakelha ishoni inolhoha inyu woona mwaattiva mwaashinene. Ukhalhawaya ninowa woonia wiira nahoukhulhuvelhani wo uthepa chinene.<verse eid="2CO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Paahi etu kihoona lazima waahoolhelhiha alha ashilhoko ihu alha uwa uwaninyu. Awe athothokaniha ni weesha tayari chittu chilhehilhe inyu ukumiha. Chiwe chooniha we ikekhiaye wiira phi chittu chilhenhe inyu ukumiha wo nrima wo uttunana, ni mena kuhiwe wo ukhanyererihiya.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Muupuwelheke wiira, naalha vakani nokhungura vakani, naalha chinchi noopatta ibarakha, nookhungura chinchi. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Paahi etu kila mmoka akumiheke ittu ilhakenlhe awe ukumiha wo nrima woombone, mena hikumihe wo uchukulha ama wo ukhanyererihiya. Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku nonttuna ntu nokumiha wo uteelhiya nrima ulhe. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Nlhuku nowooria uvahani mwaattiva wo uthepa chinene alhe anothanana inyu upatta kila mahuku. Wiira nthepeke ukavihera kila ntheko wo ibarakha unopanga inyu. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chineera aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">“Yoyo nookumiha wo nrima woombone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">Nowaavaha amashikini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">Ikekhia awe inoolhokelha mahuku o uhimalha.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Ni Nlhuku nommaha namalhima imbeyu ni yolhia, nouvahani ni inyu imbeyu chinothanana inyu, noomelhiha ni wunnuwiha ni uvahani cholhia chinchi wo urera winyu nrima. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Yoyo nouvahani mwaatti nhakhu mwinchi wo chittu chinothanana inyu mahuku onkhaye wiira nkumihe wo nrima woombone. Attu anshukuru Nlhuku wo nlhatu wo chittu chinopochera aya wo miono chihu. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Ukhalhawaya ntheko wo ukaviha unopanga inyu ulha, khunaakaviha attu a Nlhuku upatta chittu chinophavelha aya yayo vekha ayaru, nansho chiicho unowaapanga attu enchi anshukuru Nlhuku. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Ni wo nlhatu wo ntheko unooniha ihu ulha, attu anonthimicha Nlhuku wo nlhatu wo ukhulhuvelhiya winyu wo Malhove Orera a Kuristo anorumelhelha inyu wo malhaku inyu. Tho, chiicho wo nlhatu wo nrima woombone urina inyu wo waavaha attu chittu, yoyo nlhoko uyo ni attu onkhaye.<verse eid="2CO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Chiichammo etu, anowulhapelhelhani mwaattiva wo nrima ni wo nlhatu wo nnema wo vekha aya uvaheriye inyu ni Nlhuku. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Ninshukuruku Nlhuku wo nlhatu wo isawadi awe ihiri yo ulhikaanihiya!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anowiinkelha ntheko aya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Mii Paolo kimwanene kinoonia ukhalha ntu o umaalha vanokhalha aka ni inyu, nansho kichachaka vanokhalha aka utayi ni inyu mwaatti, kinoushontelhelhani wo ikiriri ni urera nrima wa Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Kinoulhepelhani wiira vanohalha aka uwa vawo, nhiwe mwaakitharamulha wiira kiwe kaachacha. Ukhalhawaya kinoowa kaachachera attu akina anonaanyihera wiira ninokhalha makhalhelho a attu o velhaponi. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Eiyo, ninokhalha velhaponi nansho khaninaatakana ikhoto thoko attu o velhaponi.<verse eid="2CO 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ukhalhawaya ikerero chinovarelha ihu waatakana ikhoto chihu khachihiwe ikerero cho velhaponi nansho cho machiri a Nlhuku anotanganyacha ingome cha amalhaponi chonkhaye. Ninootanganyacha milhatu cho woothiya chonkhaye, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />ni ukwanyulha kila itiyelhelho cho wiititihacha cheeshiye wiira chivingane ni uchuwelha wa Nlhuku. Ninoovara mateeka kila irusho wiira chinrumelhelhe Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Vanohalha ihu woona wiira urumelhelha winyu uhotimira, vavawo ninookhalha tayari untwarusha ntu riyoothe hinonrumelhelha Nlhuku.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Mwaattiva nnoweha chittu wo vatheru. Chani haawo ntu riyoothe neechaanyihera wiira yoyo phi ntu a Kuristo? Paahi, aanyihereke chiicho wiira hii chiicho phi attu a Kuristo thoko yoyo chiri awe a Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ukhalhawaya akinoona ishoni ata vakani wiishipa vakani chinene vachulhu ikuru ikivanhe aya Athithi, ikuru yo ukhomaalhihani mirima chinyu mwaatti ihikhalhaka ikuru yo ukwanyulhani. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Mii akinottuna kooniye wiira kinothanana uwoopopihani wo iwarakha chinowiiha aka uwaninyu. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ukhalhawaya ntu nowooria wiira, “Iwarakha chi Napaolo cho uchacha ni cho malhove o machiri nansho anene ayo vanokhalha aya vamoka ni hii wo iruttu anokhalha ntu o uhuperiacha. Ni ata vanolhumacha aya malhove aya anokhalha thoko khave ittu.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Ntu neera chiicho nambaya achuwelheke wiira alhe anolhepa ihu muwarakhani vanokhalha ihu utayi, phi ayo anohalha ihu upanga ikatema vanohalha ihu ukhalha ni inyu mwaatti.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Wo iphiro iriyoothe khanaalhikacha wiicheesha ama wiilhikaaniha ni attu aneeshipa ashineneru alhe. Attu aneephima ni wilhikaaniha ashineneru, yayo kharina irusho. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Nansho hii khaninefuna wo upwaha. Wiifuna wihu unowa ukhalha vanohalha aya uphimiya ntheko univanhe awe Nlhuku, ntheko unopanga ihu ata uwaninyu mwaatti. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Wiifuna wihu khawaathumpe miinano cheesheriye ihu. Ukhalhawaya vaawilhe ihu uwaninyu, uhimeriani Malhove Orera anomwaacha Kuristo, naari mminanoni mwinyu. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Paahi, khanineefunelha ntheko wa attu akina. Nansho ninokhulhuvelha wiira upisha nrima winyu unoothepa wunnuwa, ni hii ninowa nooria uvara ntheko mulhupalhe mmilhokoni mwinyu, wo uphimiya miinano chineshenre awe Nlhuku. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Vavawo ninowa nooria uhimiacha Malhove Orera wa attu o ilhapo chikina utayi ni inyu. Ni vavawo khaninowa neefunelha ntheko upangilhe aya attu akina vakitu vakina.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya, “Ntu neeshipa, eefunelheke etu ntheko upangilhe awe wa Athithi.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ukhalhawaya ntu norumelhelhelhiya kahii ntu neefuna mwaneneru, nansho nototopelhiya ni Athithi ulhe.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Napaolo ni akarumiya o woothacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Kinokhulhuvelha wiira nnookivilhelha ata kinakhalhaka ntu o uhikhalha ni irusho! Eiyo, nkivilhelheke vakani. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Kinowoonelhani ihache, nansho ihache ya Nlhuku mwanene. Ukhalhawaya, mwaattiva nri thoko mwalhi hinanarihiye kinvekinhe aka wa nlhopwana mmoka tu, Kuristo mwanene.<verse eid="2CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Nansho kinooshanga woona wiira, thoko inwaa chenre aya wo upenya nkaathepiacha Ahawa, ni inyu mwaatti irusho chinyu chinokukureehiya nkamwaahiya ukhulhuvelhiya winyu wo urera wa Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Ukhalhawaya vanowa awe ntu riyoothe nkanhimiacha Yesu nkina hiri ulhe ninonhimiacha ihu, mwaatti nnompochera wo miono miilhi ama nnompochera Iphumu ama Malhove Orera ahinolhikaana mena ni alhe apochenre inyu ukhuma uwanihu!<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Akinaanyihera wiira mii kimwankani waapwaha aneechiihana “akarumiya olhupalhe” ayo. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Veekinaka akichuwenlhe wulhumacha rata, nansho kihanaa irusho cho uchuwelha. Nahohimiacha nna nlhove nna mwaari uwaninyu, kila vakittu ni kila ikatema.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Chani kahowonya vaapannge aka wo wiitimarikha wiira kuuwelhiheni mwaatti wo uhimiacherani Malhove Orera a Nlhuku wo uhulhivihani ittu? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Vaavara aka ntheko munlhokoni mwinyu, kaapatta chittu chaaphavelha aka ukhuma wo milhoko cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo chikina. Kinowooria uhimia wiira kahaathurulha mihakhu chaya kivare ntheko wo uukavihani mwaattiva. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Ni ikatema vaari aka uwaninyu mwaatti akanhuvinhe ntu riyoothe vaathananne aka chittu chaaphavelha aka. Ashilhoko ihu yaakhumme Umakedoniya yahokiwiihera kila ittu yaathananne aka. Kaakhalha wo wiichinanelha chinene wiira kihikhalhe nsigo wo iphiro iriyoothe, ni kinoothepa wiira chiicho. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Wo ikeekhene ya Kuristo iri nhina mwaka, khaawo ntu riyoothe mu Akaya mwonkhaye, nooria ukihiiha wiishipelha nenno nlhove nno. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Nlhatu waani etu wo wulhumacha chiicho? Wiira akinoottunani mwaatti? Mena! Nlhuku noochuwelha wiira kinouttunani!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Kinoothepa upanga thoko chinopanga aka naanano, wiira kihaavahe nipesha yayo “akarumiya olhupalhe” anothanana wiishipa wiira eti anoovara ntheko unopanga ihu hii ayo. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Ukhalhawaya ayo phi akarumiya o woothacha, anamitheko o uthepiacha aneechotheriha ukhalha akarumiya a Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Akinoshanga vavawo! Ukhalhawaya ata Nakare mwanene nowiichotheriha ukhalha nnepa wo munthukoni! <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Wo chiichammo etu nenno khanihiwe nlhove no ushangiha, yakhalhakaru wiira ata akarumiya awe ni ayo aneepanga ukhalha akarumiya o mitheko chinothanana awe Nlhuku. Umalha waya anowa upatta ntwarusho unophwanelhiya aya uttwaraana ni mitheko chaya.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anoottwaruwa wo nlhatu wo ukhalha karumiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Kinohokolhelha tho wiira, ntu riyoothe hikaanyihere wiira akirina irusho. Nansho mwaanyiheraka chiicho nkooneke etu ukhalha thoko kihirina irusho, wiira ni mii kikhalhe ni ittu yo wiishipa ata vakani. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Inohimia aka vano ilha kiheena ikuru ikilhehenre aya Athithi kihimiache vachulhu nna nlhove no wiishipelha nna, kineera thoko ntu hiri ni irusho. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ukhalhawaya attu enchi aneeshipa wo nlhatu wo chittu cho velhaponi, ni mii etu kinowiishipa chiicho. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Mwaatti nneechoona phi attu o irusho? Phi nlhatu etu nnowaavilhelha ata attu ahiri ni irusho uno nteelhiyaka! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Nnonvilhelha ata ntu noopangani mwaattiva ipotta, ntu nokusha chittu chinyu, ntu nowaamererihani, ntu nooveehani ni uwaatani wiitho! <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Uno kuulhiyaka muru, kinoorumelhelha wiira hii naari o uhuperiacha!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ikhalhe chinohalha aya ukhalha, nansho akhalhaka ntu riyoothe nolhikacha wiishipelha ittu, ni mii kinolhikacha wiishipa chiicho. Mii, kinoolhumacha vano thoko ntu hiri ni irusho. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Chani yayo Aebraniya? Ni mii chiicho Muebraniya. Chani yayo Aisraeli? Ata ni mii Muisraeli chiicho. Yayo akhumme iyari ya Aburahimu? Ata ni mii chiicho kikhumme iyari ya Aburahimu. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Yayo phi anamitheko a Kuristo? Ata mii kinoolhumacha thoko ntu o ihalhahalha va, phi karumiya a Kuristo waapwaha ayo. Mii kihovara ntheko wo urikarika waapwaha ayo, kihottukiya ujeerani waapwaha ayo, kihaatakachiya mikwaju venchi waaapwaha ayo ni kahomwaatameria nookhwa venchi waapwaha ayo. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Wo mikwaha nthanu kahaafiulhiya ni Ayahudi mikwaju makhumi mararu khuwa tisa.<verse eid="2CO 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Kahaatiya ikopo ni Arumi mikwaha miraru, nkakaatiya malhuku nkwaha mmoka. Imeli yahokuntheelha mikwaha miraru, nkakaashelhelhiha mwommo mmaashini mmo uhiyu nkwee ni uthana vii. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Kiheetakacha mikwaha chinchi nkakaakumaana itatako cho utitimira mmaashini, cha attu o uvara makhuche, wa anenchi nanaka, wa attu ahiri Ayahudi. Tho wa attu o mmawaani, cho wiithuphini, cho mmaashini ni itatako ukhuma wa ashilhoko aka o woothacha.<verse eid="2CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Kihovara ntheko ni uhuva chinene, kihoshelhelhiha wo uhirupa ikhove venchi. Kihowolhiya ithalha ni nttona venchi. Kihottuka venchi ni uririiya wo uhikhalha ni ikuwo yo wiikhuneelha. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Wo uhaalhakelhaka chittu chikina chinchi, kila nihuku kinowehereriya ni mitheko cho waakaviha milhoko chonkhaye cha attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ntu riyoothe ahupeeriaka ni mii kinoohuperia, ntu riyoothe awonyihiyaka, ni mii kinookelhiya ichuku munrimani.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Keeshipaka, kineeshipa wo nlhatu wo uhuperia waka. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Atotopelhiye Nlhuku ni Athumwanaya Athithi Yesu mahuku o uhimalha. Yayo ahochuwelha wiira akinoothacha. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Vaari aka Udameski nholhelhi o mkoa ri nkavihi a amwene Naareta, aheesha manyaasikari olhitelhelha wiira akivare. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Nansho kahokurushiya kinakhanlhe nttutuni, ittutu yulhupalhe. Nkakaaperettihiya vandirishani vashirini yaarukureria iwani iyo nkayaakurusha, nkakaakulhuphuwa mmathathani mwawe.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Itora ni Upatakulhelhiya u Napaolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Kinowiishipa etu, inakhalhaka khinlhoka! Nansho vano kinowulhumacha mwaha wo chonne aka ntorani ni upatakulhelhiya ni Athithi. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Kihonchuwelha ntu mmoka anrumelhenlhe Kuristo iyaakha khumi ni ncheshe chivinre aatheeshiye mpaka irimu yo neraru. Akichuwenlhe yakhalhaka aari wowo wo iruttu ama wo nnepa, Nlhuku phi nochuwelha. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Kinoohokolhelha, kihonchuwelha yoyo ntu aakushiye mpaka uphioni uyo. Nansho akichuwenlhe yakhalhaka aari wowo wo iruttu ama wo nnepa, Nlhuku phi nochuwelha. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Wowo uphiooni uwo nkeewa malhove avithiye ahinorera ntu wuulhumachiya. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Paahi kinowiishipa wo nlhatu wo ntu thoko yoyo, nansho akineshipa wo nlhatu waka mii kimwanene, yaahikalheru wo nlhatu wo uhuperia waka. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Kikaathananne wiishipa, kakaakhalha ntu hiri ni irusho ata vakani, ukhalhawaya kikaari kuulhumachaka ikeekhene. Nansho akineeshipa ukhalhawaya akinottuna ntu akaanyihere upwaha ittu ikonne awe ni ukiiwa mmakhalhelhoni mwaka.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Nansho wo nlhatu wo uthanana wiira kihiishipe wo nlhatu wo upatakulhelhiya wonne aka, kahohomiya ittu yo uweeria mwiiruttuni mwaka thoko o uhomiya mwiiwa. Yeyo yaari thoko karumiya a Nakare, aarumiye wiira akiwerie kihiishipe wo upwaha. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Kahaashontelhelha Athithi mikwaha miraru wiira ittu ilha ikithame. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Nansho nkayaakiirelha, “Nnema aka unouthoshani, ukhalhawaya machiri aka anowunchereria ikatema vanohuperia inyu.” Paahi kinowiishipelha uhuperia waka wiira wooria wawe Kuristo ukhalhe vachulhu waka. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Paahi etu kinooteelhiya vanohuperia aka ni uveehiya, uhuvihiya, unyoholhiya ni utwarushiya wo nlhatu wo uvara ntheko wa Kuristo. Ukhalhawaya vanohuperia aka phi vavawo vanokhalha aka ni machiri.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anowopuwelha attu o Ukorintho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Kiri thoko ntu hiri ni irusho, nansho mwaatti phi kikhanyererinhe kikhalhe thoko chiicho. Mwaattiva phi inyu nkaaphwanelhiye ukitotopelha. Ukhalhawaya inakhalhaka mii akihii ittu nansho wo iphiro iriyoothe mii akihii mwankani waapwaha ayo aneechiihana “akarumiya olhupalhe” ayo. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Ithikineha ni cho ushangiha cho wooniha mwaari wiira mii phi karumiya e ikekhiaye, chahopangiya mmilhokoni mwinyu wo uvilhelha wonkhaye. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Chani, ittu yaani kahaapannge aka uwaninyu kipannge aka wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo akina ayo? Ama ukhalhawaya akohuvinheni wiira nkivahe ittu yo ukikavihera ukhuma uwaninyu? Nkihiyerereke etu wo upangelhani ittu yo uhilhoka!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Vano ulha unookhalha nkwaha wo neraru uwa uwaninyu ni mena akinowa kaakhalha nsigo uwaninyu, akinowa kaavekelha ittu wa ntu. Ukhalhawaya ittu inaavia aka kihii nhakhu inyu nansho kinowaaviani mwaattiva mwaashinene. Phi malhemalhelho, manyanaangoro waashungera achishaana aya chittu, kuhiwe ashaana waashungera manyanaangoro aya chittu. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Mii kinooteelhiya ukumiha kila ittu irina aka, ata wiikumiha mii kimwanene wo nlhatu wo minepa chinyu. Chani, nnohalha ukittuna vakani wo nlhatu wo uttunani chinene mwaatti?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Paahi nnoorumelhelha wiira, akankhulhuvenlhe ntu uwaninyu mwaatti. Nansho veekinaka ntu nkina nowooria wiira, ukhalhawaya Napaolo ntu o upenya chinene, ahothepiachani. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Chani mii kahoothurulhani ittu vaarumme aka akarumiya uwaninyu? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Mii kaheehana Natito, nkakaaruma uwaninyu ni munnihu nkina. Chani, Natito yahoothurulhani ittu iriyoothe? Paahi etu nchuwelheke wiira, hii ninopanga chittu wo uholhelhiya ni nrima yoyo yoyo ni meetelho ihu ari mamoka.<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Veekinaka nnaanyihera wiira mpaka nna naari niivaraangaka naashinene mmiholho winyu. Mena! Ninoolhumacha mmiholho wa Nlhuku ni ukhalha muulhutaanani ni Kuristo. Ashilhoko ihu, ninaattuna ihu, chittu chonkhaye chinopanga ihu, ninopanga wo nlhatu wo ukhomaalhihani mwaattiva. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ukhalhawaya kinowoova wiira vanohalha aka uwa uwaninyu vawo kinoowa koophwanyani mpangaka chittu cho unanara chihinottuna aka, nkamwaakona chihinapatta inyu ukoona. Kinowoova kihiwe kaaphwanya indewo, ihache, uhiiwanana, uvaanyihana, waapana ni waapa attu, wiichoona ni injarare munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Kinoova wiira vanohalha aka uwa nkwaha unowa vawo, Nlhuku aka nowa akuulhiha muru munlhokoni mwinyu. Ni mii kinoowa kaachukulha wo nlhatu wa attu enchi awonyilhe nansho ahikhoromaka ni uhiya unyalha waya uwo ni nikakata naya no ishembwere ni ulhavalhava thoko mwalhapwa ulhavalhanve aya.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anowaalhaka attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo o Ukorintho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Ulha phi nkwaha aka wo neraru kinolhakelha aka uwa uwaninyu. Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Kila nlhatu unoolhumachiya wo uhimiecheshiya ni attu elhi ama o uthepa vavawo.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Kahowaamukani vaawilhe aka nkwaha wo nayelhi. Vano kinohimiacha tho kinari utayi, vanohalha aka uwa vawo attu onkhaye awonnye ni bado anoothepa uwonya, ni akina alhe akinowa koonelha ikiriri. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Nnowoona mwaashinene wiira Kuristo nolhumacha wo iphiro aka. Ni vavawo etu, vanovara ntheko mmilhokoni mwinyu kanhupeeria, nowooniha machiri awe munlhokoni mwinyu ikatema chonkhaye. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Inakhalhaka Kuristo ari o uhuperia vaahokhomelhelhiye awe vansalaabani, nansho vano rii nkumi wo wooria wa Nlhuku. Ni hii chiicho niri o uhuperiacha wo ulhutaana ni uyo. Nansho ninoopatta ukumi vamoka ni uyo wo iphiro yo machiri a Nlhuku, noorie uvara ntheko munlhokoni mwinyu.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Mwiiwehaweheke mwaashinene, mwoone yakhalhaka we ikekhiaye nheemelha rata mu upishani nrima. Chani khanchuwelhe wiira Yesu Kuristo rii nhina mwinyu? Yahikhalheke chiicho etu, mwaatti nhoochelha. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Nansho kinokhulhuvelha nhochuwelha wiira hii khanikhotiye. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Ninonlhapelha Nlhuku wiira nhipange mwo uhilhoka muriwoothe, nihooniye thoko attu apantte. Nansho mpangeke mwo urera ata inakhalhaka hii ninooniya wiira nihoochelha. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Ukhalhawaya khaninooria uvaanyiha ikeekhene, wooria urina ihu urii wo uthepiha ikeekhene. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Ninoteelhiya nrima wo woona wiira vaari ihu attu o uhuperiacha, mwaatti mwaari attu o machiri. Wo chiichammo etu ninonlhapelha Nlhuku wiira, nkhalheke attu ahiwukuwelhiye wo kila ittu. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, kinolhepa ilha iwarakha ilha kinari utayi wiira vanohalha aka uwa uwaninyu, kihiwe koochacherani wo ikuru ikivanhe aya Athithi. Eiyo, wooria wo ukhomaalhiha mirima chinyu mwaatti, kuhii uririhani.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikano ni isalamu cho umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Wo naanano va, ashilhoko aka, kineera, nikwaha! Nhiwukuwelhiye ittu iriyoothe, nvarechesheke malhove aka, nkhalheke ni nrima mmoka, nkhalheke wo mpuha. Ni uyo Nlhuku o uttunana ni o mpuha akhalhe vamoka ni inyu mwaatti. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Nshikurianeke kila mmoka wo wooniha wiira mwa attu nnottunana thoko Kuristo chenre awe wo unittuna.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13-14" />Nlhoko wa atakatifu anottuniya ni Nlhuku uno anouvahani isalamu. Nnema wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo ni uttuna wa Nlhuku ni unlhoko ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku chikhalhe ni inyu mwaattiva onkhaye.<verse eid="2CO 13:13-14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>